  "all_ingredients_flat": "brown rice powder, urad dal, chana dal, ginger, garlic cloves, green chillies, cilantro, spinach, coriander powder, Garam Masala, turmeric, asafetida (hing), salt, red onion, lemon juice",
  "instructions": "DOUGH: Make a soft dough by adding hot boiling water to brown rice powder.\nSPICY DAL MIX: Soak for 2-3 hrs: 1 cup of urad dal & 1 cup of chana dal. Blend them coarsely with a ginger piece, garlic cloves & green chillies. Add finely chopped cilantro and spinach, coriander powder, a pinch of Garam Masala, turmeric, asafetida (hing) & salt to taste. Mix well.\nMake dumplings with DOUGH & SPICY DAL MIX (pics 1, 2 & 3). Steam them for 20 mins.\nServe them with Green Chutney (pic 4) or chop them up (pic 5) and roast them with red onion, lemon juice & Garam Masala (pic 6).",
  "cooking_methods": [
    "no-cook",
    "blend",
    "steam",
    "roast"
  ],
  "serving_suggestion": "Serve them with Green Chutney (pic 4) or chop them up (pic 5) and roast them with red onion, lemon juice & Garam Masala (pic 6).",
  "notes": "Green Chutney (sub-recipe mentioned for serving)",
